      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "By \"starts to disappear\", do you mean it seems like the camera is going \"through\" their avatar?\n\nIf that is the case, that is defined by the \"near-clipping plane\" setting for the world. For extremely small avatars, the placement of this plane can be exaggerated and will make it seem like geometry is disappearing too close to your face.\n\nYou can fix this two ways:\n- Use a larger avatar\n- Change the \"near-clipping\" plane in the Camera settings for the world you're in\n\nThere is no way to adjust this plane for individual users.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
